==German==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|hoh|hōh|lang=goh}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|De-at-hoch.ogg|audio (Austria)}}
* {{IPA|/hoːx/|lang=de}}

===Adjective===
{{de-adj|höher|höchsten}}

# [[high]], [[tall]]
# [[large]], [[big]], [[heavy]]
# [[grand]], [[important]]

====Usage notes====
* As a predicative (after the verbs ''[[sein]]'' "be", ''[[werden]]'' "become" and ''[[bleiben]]'' "remain") the form '''hoch''' is used, but when declined, as an attribute, the form is '''hoh-'''.
: ''Der Preis ist '''hoch'''.'' The price is high.
: '''''hoh'''e Preise'' high prices

